{
  "uid": "dns-blockaden",
  "title": "DNS-Blockaden",
  "tags": [
    "cilium",
    "sicherheit"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Blockierte DNS-Abfragen im Zeitraum",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "description": "Vom DNS-Proxy des Cilium-Agents abgelehnt (cilium_policy_l7_total). Zählt jede Ablehnung, unabhängig vom Namespace.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(cilium_policy_l7_total{proxy_type=\"fqdn\", rule=\"denied\"}[$__range])))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Namespaces mit Blockaden",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count((sum by (source_namespace) (increase(hubble_flows_processed_total{type=\"L7\", subtype=\"DNS\", verdict=\"DROPPED\"}[$__range])) > 0) or (sum by (source_namespace) (hubble_flows_processed_total{type=\"L7\", subtype=\"DNS\", verdict=\"DROPPED\"} unless hubble_flows_processed_total{type=\"L7\", subtype=\"DNS\", verdict=\"DROPPED\"} offset $__range) > 0)) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Mitgezählt auch ein Namespace, dessen erste Ablehnung die Zeitreihe erst angelegt hat - increase allein sähe sie nicht."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Welche Namen?",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Die Namen blockierter Abfragen stehen in keiner Metrik - Hubble führt sie nur als Flow:\n\n```\nkubectl -n kube-system exec ds/cilium -c cilium-agent -- \\\n  hubble observe --protocol DNS --verdict DROPPED --last 100\n```\n\nAlarm: `DnsAbfrageBlockiert` (observability-rules/DnsBlockRules.yaml), ntfy-Topic `cluster`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Blockierte DNS-Abfragen je Namespace",
      "description": "Hubble: L7-DNS-Flows mit Verdict DROPPED.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (source_namespace) (increase(hubble_flows_processed_total{type=\"L7\", subtype=\"DNS\", verdict=\"DROPPED\"}[$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source_namespace}}",
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "DNS-Proxy: weitergeleitet und abgelehnt",
      "description": "Alle Abfragen, die durch Ciliums DNS-Proxy laufen (Namespaces mit DNS-Regel).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (rule) (rate(cilium_policy_l7_total{proxy_type=\"fqdn\", rule=~\"forwarded|denied\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rule}}",
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Verworfene Pakete je Namespace und Grund",
      "description": "L3/L4: abgewiesene Verbindungen, z.B. ein Ziel außerhalb der toFQDNs-Liste (POLICY_DENIED).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "pps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (source_namespace, reason) (rate(hubble_drop_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source_namespace}} - {{reason}}",
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  }
}